WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.069
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.237
We hope you're all
doing well tonight

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.838
and, now, we are going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:08.174
President Biden is set tomorrow

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:10.309
to pardon the annual
White House turkey

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:14.179
and Steve Bannon's got an idea
just crazy enough to work.

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:16.415
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:19.085
After test driving
an electric Hummer pickup truck

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.220
in Michigan yesterday,
President Biden said,

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.789
"This sucker's something else."

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.924
Okay, but, don't give him one.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.726
I mean, the last thing
anyone needs is

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:30.630
a 78-year-old man driving a car
that you can't hear coming.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.699
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.667
After Texas Senator Ted Cruz

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.836
accused Republican
Congresswoman Liz Cheney,

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:39.738
in a recent interview, of having
Trump Derangement Syndrome,

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:42.809
Cheney tweeted,
"Trump broke Ted Cruz."

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:46.312
Yeah, but that's like breaking
an IKEA bookshelf.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.381
It was about to go, anyway.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.216
[ Laughter ]
"You put books on it?!

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:52.819
Ohh!
You can't put books on it!"

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.220
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.855
Fox Chairman Rupert Murdoch

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.657
reportedly told News Corp's
shareholders -- stockholders --

00:00:58.657 --> 00:01:00.092
Excuse me.
Shareholders, stockholders --

00:01:00.092 --> 00:01:01.127
I think it's the same.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:02.761
What do you want to go with,
Baze?

00:01:02.761 --> 00:01:04.363
-Share.
-I think stock's funnier.

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:07.533
[ Laughter and applause ]
Stockholders at a recent meeting

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:10.002
that former President Trump
"needs to move on"

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:11.103
from the 2021 election.

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:12.705
Okay, but you, first.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.140
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:17.309
Probably hurt the joke,
doing that little size trip,

00:01:17.309 --> 00:01:18.645
but I got my Baze burn in.

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:21.047
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.249
The NFL announced yesterday
that it will heighten

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:26.652
its coronavirus protocols amid
rising cases across the country.

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:29.222
Starting this weekend,
Aaron Rodgers will be forced

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.956
to attend the huddle via Zoom.

00:01:30.956 --> 00:01:32.525
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:35.828
New York's MTA announced
yesterday that it has approved

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:38.897
the purchase
of 60 fully electric buses,

00:01:38.897 --> 00:01:42.468
which cost about $1 million each
and have a top speed of

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:43.736
we'll never know.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:46.505
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:49.142
The discount department store
chain T.J.Maxx

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:51.243
announced yesterday
that it will increase prices

00:01:51.243 --> 00:01:54.414
on some of its upscale brands
and you'll know they're upscale

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:56.548
because they're the ones not
on the floor.

00:01:56.548 --> 00:01:58.785
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.053
New York Jets quarterback
Joe Flacco announced

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:02.421
at a press conference yesterday

00:02:02.421 --> 00:02:04.757
that he is not vaccinated
against the coronavirus

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:07.393
and said that he
"has his reasons."

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:09.895
I mean, he's a backup
quarterback on the Jets.

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:12.398
I assume his reason is
that he's ready to die.

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:16.502
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:19.371
That's right, New York Jets
quarterback Joe Flacco announced

00:02:19.371 --> 00:02:21.674
he's not vaccinated
against the coronavirus,

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:23.309
but don't worry
about his teammates.

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:25.644
It's rare for the Jets
to catch anything.

00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:28.148
[ Laughter, ohs, and applause ]

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:31.951
Yeah, why not?
Why not? Yeah.

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:33.019
Enjoy yourselves.

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:36.322
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:39.125
And, finally, tomorrow is
National Play Monopoly Day,

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.493
which means this Saturday is

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:42.161
National Finish Monopoly Day.

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:44.597
[ Laughter ]
You guys, that was a monologue!

